\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ueqR02mtOXAQ7kNvwHRKafe&_nc_oc=Adlx7SkAqKF4-BSmQlfIYDJTp1b8Xz40QyFpQRqN8TL2vds6W4FLL5aUrafC1logp9k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwaJMshk40i2PvI0glA_hUxlVfwulIB-5CX-zIf9WuH1A&oe=69B69674"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=R3_MHlOCz30Q7kNvwGGfJF-&_nc_oc=AdkxrMo3Q52ur-MeAV7FhRjG-ITv3bfNhTtnswL5LktuGLJT0M0BXqBRKE4Dves-KBk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afx8GdAxolau0jCa7Y6hwj4edwE1D3zCAEfm7Gepwg5L-g&oe=69B697D6"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RpuHjxVTmfoQ7kNvwFwz8pP&_nc_oc=AdmJj3wJakVvVZDhRDcjB0_TpndZLiyJAZzGZuK5Uwb38BcpXOQu-L9pNpGqlIk1DPQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyvN19qIeurQbI2pKaCnCPY7aKFVITHa4oFq3WqM1VmuQ&oe=69B6ACF7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771